                                "sense_id": "a9267fef-c5d8-385b-9951-e7e3300a3b8f",
                                "text": "De religiositeiten van verschillende culturen kunnen sterk variëren.",
                                "translation": "The religiosities of different cultures can vary greatly.",
                                "english": "The religiosities of different cultures can vary greatly."
                            },
                            {
